  "steps": [
    "In a blender add 150g or 1 cup Boiled Black Chana (Black Chickpeas / Kala Chana), 150g or 1 cup Dates (soaked in warm water), 30g Cocoa Powder (1/4 cup), 1 tsp Vanilla Extract (5ml), Pinch of salt, 30ml water (add more of it isn’t blending)",
